schema: signal
object:
  title: "Composite/anonymized adoption narratives should not become person-nodes"
  type: signal
  signal_type: content
  affected_layer: layer-9-evolution-signals
  interpretation: >-
    The three stories in this article (Maria, climate coalition, ReFi
    Africa) are illustrative case narratives drawn from secondary toolkit
    sources, not independently verified individual accounts. They usefully
    illustrate a recurring on-ramp pattern (start small, find one ally,
    iterate through mistakes, stay mission-focused) worth preserving as a
    concept, but should not be treated as verified citations or expanded
    into named person/org profiles without going back to the original
    sourced toolkits for consent and verification.
  proposed_intervention: preserve
